Build checks for the OnePlus 6 camera VDI (device/board/oneplus 0007), as rk3568's camera VDI has them:
- core/gn/ohos_exec_script_allowlist.gni: its BUILD.gn may call exec_script (like rk3568's and dayu210's, it
  touches the pipeline config sources it copies into drivers/peripheral/camera before GN reads them); without
  the entry GN stops with "Disallowed exec_script call".
- compile_standard_whitelist.json: its targets use external_deps and deps that the board's part
  (qualcomm_products, no bundle.json listing its deps) does not declare, as the port's other vendor libraries
  are allowed to; without the entries their __check steps fail ("need set part deps info to
  qualcomm_products", "deps validation ... failed").

